{"id": "21-1573-2-5", "zh": "两个半称为 aḍḍhateyya；diyaḍḍha", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-1574-2-5", "zh": "与 divaḍḍha 则指一个半（第二个只取一半）。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "21-1575-2-14", "zh": "度量（māna）有三种：用秤（tulā）称重，用斗（pattha）量容积，用指（aṅguli）量长度。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1577-2-5", "zh": "四粒稻谷为一 guñjā（相思豆），", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1578-2-6", "zh": "两个 guñjā 为一 māsaka；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1579-2-10", "zh": "五个 māsaka 为一 akkha，八个 akkha 为一 dharaṇa。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-1581-2-9", "zh": "五个 dharaṇa 为一 suvaṇṇa；五个 suvaṇṇa 为一 nikkha（非阴性）；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1582-2-10", "zh": "pāda 指四分之一；十个 dharaṇa 为一 pala。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1584-2-10", "zh": "一百个 pala 为一 tulā；二十个 tulā 为一 bhāra；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1585-2-8", "zh": "kahāpaṇa（非阴性）又称为 karisāpaṇa。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1587-2-5", "zh": "kuḍuva 就是 pasata（一捧），", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1588-2-6", "zh": "四个 kuḍuva 为一 pattha；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1589-2-10", "zh": "四个 pattha 为一 āḷhaka；四个 āḷhaka 为一 doṇa，也称为 caturāḷhaka。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1591-2-9", "zh": "四个 doṇa 为一 mānikā；四个 mānikā 为一 khārī（阴性）；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1592-2-6", "zh": "二十个 khārī 为一 vāha，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1593-2-5", "zh": "十个 ambaṇa 为一 kumbha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1595-2-9", "zh": "āḷhaka（非阴性）也称为 tumbha；pattha 也称为 nāḷi（阴性）；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1596-2-6", "zh": "vāha 也称为 sakaṭa（一车），", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1597-2-6", "zh": "十个 doṇa 为一 ambaṇa。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1599-2-5", "zh": "份额称为 paṭivīsa、koṭṭhāsa、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1600-2-7", "zh": "aṃsa、bhāga；财富称为 dhana、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1601-2-11", "zh": "dabba、vitta、sāpateyya、vasu、attha、vibhava。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1603-2-12", "zh": "kosa 与 hirañña 指加工过和未加工的金与银；", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-1604-2-9", "zh": "除此以外的铜等金属称为 kuppa；rūpiya 则兼指金银二者。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-1606-2-9", "zh": "金子称为 suvaṇṇa、kanaka、jātarūpa、soṇṇa、kañcana、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1607-2-9", "zh": "satthuvaṇṇa、harī、kambu、cāru、hema、hāṭaka。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1609-2-9", "zh": "还有 tapanīya、hirañña；金子的种类有 cāmīkara，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1610-2-10", "zh": "以及 sātakumbha、jambunada 和 siṅgī（阴性）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1612-2-10", "zh": "银子称为 rūpiya、rajata、sajjhu、rūpī、sajjha；又，vasu、", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1613-2-9", "zh": "ratana 与 maṇi（用于两种性）指宝石，puppharāga 等是它的种类。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1615-2-9", "zh": "金、银、珍珠、摩尼宝珠、琉璃，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1616-2-11", "zh": "再加上金刚石和珊瑚，这些称为七宝。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1618-2-9", "zh": "lohitaṅka 和 padumarāga 指红色的宝石；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1619-2-9", "zh": "琉璃（veḷuriya）又称 vaṃsavaṇṇa；珊瑚称为 pavāḷa 或 vidduma。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1621-2-9", "zh": "masāragalla 就是杂色宝石（kabaramaṇi）；珍珠称为 muttā 和 muttikā；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1622-2-19", "zh": "黄铜称为 rīti（阴性）或 ārakūṭa；云母称为 abbhaka，也叫 amala。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1624-2-6", "zh": "铁称为 loha（非阴性）、aya、kāḷāyasa，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1625-2-5", "zh": "水银称为 pārada、rasa；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1626-2-9", "zh": "铅称为 kāḷatipu 和 sīsa；雌黄称为 haritāla，也叫 pītana。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1628-2-9", "zh": "朱砂称为 cīnapiṭṭha 和 sindūra；棉花称为 tūla 和 picu；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1629-2-10", "zh": "蜂蜜称为 khuddaja、madhu、khudda；蜂蜡称为 madhucchiṭṭha，也叫 sitthaka。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1631-2-5", "zh": "牧牛人称为 gopāla、gopa、gosaṅkhya，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1632-2-6", "zh": "牛的主人称为 gomā 和 gomika；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1633-2-16", "zh": "公牛称为 usabha、balībadda、goṇa、govasabha、vusa。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1635-2-10", "zh": "老牛称为 vuddha 和 jaraggava；尚待调教的小牛称为 damma 和 vacchatara，二者同义；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1636-2-9", "zh": "拉轭的牛称为 dhuravāhī 和 dhorayha；govinda 指牛群的管理者。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1638-2-17", "zh": "牛肩负轭的部位称为 vaha 和 khandhadesa；牛的肩峰称为 kakudha 或 kaku；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1639-2-9", "zh": "牛角称为 visāṇa 和 siṅga；红色的母牛称为 rohiṇī。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1641-2-12", "zh": "母牛称为 gāvī、siṅginī 和 go；不能生育的母牛称为 vañjhā，也叫 vasā；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1642-2-8", "zh": "刚生下小牛的母牛称为 dhenu；疼爱小牛的母牛称为 vacchalā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1644-2-9", "zh": "搅乳棒称为 gaggarī 和 manthanī（阴性），共两个名称；绳索称为 sandāna 和 dāma；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1645-2-10", "zh": "牛粪称为 gomiḷha、gomaya（非阴性）；熟酥称为 sappi，也叫 ghata。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1647-2-10", "zh": "刚提取出来的称为生酥（nonīta）；乳清称为 dadhimaṇḍa，也叫 matthu；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1648-2-11", "zh": "乳汁称为 khīra、duddha、paya、thañña；酪浆称为 takka，也叫 mathita。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1650-2-10", "zh": "乳、酪、熟酥、酪浆、生酥，这五种是牛的产物（gorasa）；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1651-2-10", "zh": "公羊称为 urabbha、meṇḍa、mesa、uraṇa、avi、eḷaka。", "confidence": 70}
